  <p>The most important takeaway is this: your rate is not a fixed number. It should evolve as your skills grow, your expenses change, and your confidence increases. Revisit your pricing at least once a year using the bottom-up method as your floor, then adjust upward based on the value you deliver. Your freelance business deserves to be profitable, sustainable, and rewarding.</p>

